🎯 Learning Objectives
Through this learning plan, I aim to:
* Understand the fundamentals of Visual Studio Code
* Learn how to navigate and customize the VS Code environment
* Explore extensions and developer tools
* Learn useful keyboard shortcuts and productivity features
* Understand debugging and source control in Visual Studio Code
* Build practical skills for using Visual Studio Code in software development

Upon completion of this learning plan, learners will have a solid foundation in using Visual Studio Code effectively for their development workflow.

